1
00:00:04,341 --> 00:00:05,381
(Sheldon:)Hold on.

2
00:00:05,593 --> 00:00:08,593
Do you honestly expect me to believe
social protocol dictates...

3
00:00:08,804 --> 00:00:14,054
(Sheldon:)...we break our backs helping Wolowitz
move, and he only need buy us a pizza?

4
00:00:14,476 --> 00:00:17,896
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, that really is how it works.

5
00:00:18,105 --> 00:00:19,985
(Sheldon:)You're tricking me.

6
00:00:20,858 --> 00:00:23,198
(Sheldon:)- Tell me the truth, what do we get?
- Ha.

7
00:00:23,986 --> 00:00:25,616
(Leonard:)Raj, help me out here.

8
00:00:25,779 --> 00:00:28,489
(Raj:)You get to choose
between a mountain bike or a PS3.

9
00:00:28,699 --> 00:00:30,449
(Sheldon:)I knew it.

10
00:00:31,702 --> 00:00:34,082
- PS3, definitely PS3.
- Mm-hm.

11
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:35,788
(Sheldon:)Who would pick a mountain bike?

12
00:00:37,625 --> 00:00:41,295
HOWARD: Enough with the guilt, Ma.
We'll still see each other.

13
00:00:41,503 --> 00:00:43,923
(Howard(voice from inside):)I'll come over every night
and have dinner with you.

14
00:00:44,131 --> 00:00:46,591
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
The hell you will!

15
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:51,140
(Howard's Mother(voice):)What am I running here,
a fancy restaurant?

16
00:00:51,347 --> 00:00:53,557
(Howard's Mother(voice):)Does this look like Olive Garden?

17
00:00:55,643 --> 00:00:57,143
HOWARD:
Okay, I get it, you're angry.

18
00:00:57,353 --> 00:01:00,483
You don't wanna see
your little bird leave the nest.

19
00:01:00,648 --> 00:01:04,028
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Little bird? You're almost 30!

